2	//! Storage service for GeoPalette Pulse core.
3	//!
4	//! Handles persistence of user–generated palettes, brushes, in-app-purchase receipts
5	//! and misc. app state.  Implements an event-driven autosave layer by listening
6	//! to `DomainEvent`s on the global `EventBus`.  All I/O is carried out
7	//! asynchronously on the Tokio runtime.
8	//!
9	//! The module follows these design goals:
10	//!   • Thread-safe, non-blocking I/O (Tokio + `RwLock`).
11	//!   • Loosely-coupled Observer integration (`EventBus`).
12	//!   • Pluggable backend via `StorageService` trait (file-system by default).
13	//!   • Error resiliency with typed `StorageError`.
14	//!
15	//! Other crates needed (add to Cargo.toml):
16	//! ```toml
17	//! async-trait = "0.1"
18	//! once_cell   = "1"
19	//! parking_lot = "0.12"
20	//! serde       = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }
21	//! serde_json  = "1"
22	//! thiserror   = "1"
23	//! tokio       = { version = "1", features = ["fs", "rt-multi-thread", "macros"] }
24	//! ```
25	//!
26	//! Optional (behind `biometric_auth` feature flag):
27	//! ```toml
28	//! ring = "0.17"
29	//! ```
