2	//! Domain events and the (very) light-weight, thread-safe Observer bus that
3	//! glues GeoPalette Pulse together.
4	//!
5	//! Every meaningful occurrence inside the core domain is captured as a
6	//! `DomainEvent`.  Modules can publish new events and/or subscribe to the bus
7	//! in order to be notified asynchronously without creating tight coupling.
8	//!
9	//! The implementation purposefully tries to stay `no_std` friendly (apart from
10	//! a few well-curated dependencies) so it can be reused by both the mobile
11	//! front-end and potential WASM targets.
