2	//! Integration tests for the palette-generation pipeline.
3	//!
4	//! These tests exercise several critical paths of the core domain:
5	//!   1. Palette generation from deterministic sensor samples
6	//!   2. Observer-bus dispatch semantics
7	//!   3. Concurrency safety under heavy load
8	//!   4. (De)serialization guarantees
9	//!
10	//! The tests purposefully rely **only** on the public API of the
11	//! `geopalette_pulse_core` crate, never reaching into private modules.
12	//! This mirrors how the library will be consumed “for real” by the
13	//! higher-level UI and companion services.
